on**  \n","   - Extracción de pares futuros (`Future_Connections.csv`)  \n","   - Embeddings de GCN, Node2Vec, heurísticas y GAE/VGAE  \n","   - Clasificadores (Logistic, MLP, XGBoost)  \n","   - Evaluación con AUC-ROC  \n","  \n"],"metadata":{"id":"qxtC-wEE17TN"},"id":"qxtC-wEE17TN"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"m2QY1hQG17Pi"},"id":"m2QY1hQG17Pi"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"cy-7vOkf17MC"},"id":"cy-7vOkf17MC"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":[],"metadata":{"id":"FadP1nca17Hi"},"id":"FadP1nca17Hi"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["##Preparación de datos"],"metadata":{"id":"-abhjdRv2VeN"},"id":"-abhjdRv2VeN"},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Instalar dependencias de datos y modelos\n","!pip install xgboost --quiet\n","!pip install torch-cluster -f https://data.pyg.org/whl/torch-2.0.0+cpu.html\n","!pip install --quiet numpy==1.24.4 pandas networkx scipy==1.10.1 gensim==4.3.2 xgboost node2vec==0.3.0\n","\n","# Instalar PyTorch CPU y ecosistema\n","!pip install --quiet torch torchvision torchaudio --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu\n","!pip install --quiet torch-cluster -f https://data.pyg.org/whl/torch-2.0.0+cpu.html\n","!pip install --quiet torch-geometric\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"gIisG_EqEeKr","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1747500676505,"user_tz":300,"elapsed":26563,"user":{"displayName":"PEDRO LUIS PEREZ BARAHONA","userId":"16526492446743362157"}},"outputId":"5348f82c-dcce-4c97-e4c9-3437f8139dd1"},"id":"gIisG_EqEeKr","execution_count":null,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Looking in links: https://data.pyg.org/whl/torch-2.0.0+cpu.html\n","Requirement already satisfied: torch-cluster in /usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages (1.6.3+pt20cpu)\n","Requirement already satisfied: scipy in /usr/local/lib/python3.11/dist-packages (from torch-cluster) (1.10.1)\n","Requirement already satisfied: numpy<1.27.0,>=1.19.5 in /usr/